\b0 Math is a module which demonstrates how to build Resound modules.  Its source code is located in the 
\i APIExamples
\i0  directory.  Math's operations work for 8-bit linear, 8-bit mulaw, 16-bit linear, floating-point and double-precision floating-point sounds. \
\
\
Math adds to the Modules menu the following menu options:\
